<title>INDIA: Cricket- Australia score 238 for six in 50 overs.</title>
<headline>Cricket- Australia score 238 for six in 50 overs.</headline>
<dateline>GUWAHATI, India 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia scored 238 for six in their 50 overs after electing to bat against South Africa in the Titan Cup triangular limited-over series preliminary league match here on Friday.</p>
</text>
